{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112841295123410944"]}, "author_id": "2069320507586125824", "created_at": "2026-10-22T01:33:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113081216429932994"], "id": "2113081216429932994", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "SINOSTAR x Zhujiang Hospital at the Canton Fair.\nNot just a booth. Real conversations.\n🔬 Robotic surgery\n🧠 Brain-computer interface \n🌏 Patients from 133 countries\nWe talked about everything from transferring a patient from London in a week, to trying TCM after a long day. https://t.co/jnkU8FL7Su", "url": "https://x.com/SinostarHealth/status/2113081216429932994"}, {"author_id": "365946079", "created_at": "2026-10-21T22:22:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113033176272753000"], "id": "2113033176272753000", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 4281, "like_count": 50, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 21, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112855396041847240", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is the battle that will determine the next century and so few even understand it's coming.\n\nPro-AI versus anti-AI.\n\nIt will heat up enormously by the time humanoids exist at scale, and in the early 2030s when brain computer interface tech becomes viable.\n\nTo merge or not to https://t.co/EXpmkPAjdC", "url": "https://x.com/rationalaussie/status/2113033176272753000"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113125898987687936"]}, "author_id": "1219773626532204549", "created_at": "2026-10-22T04:31:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113126003094499829"], "id": "2113126003094499829", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 105, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Right now Neuralink participants are controlling computers, robotic arms, and even powered wheelchairs with their thoughts. One ALS patient has already spoken “I love you” in his own pre-disease voice. That’s pure output — the brain speaking, the chip listening.\nThe next chapter https://t.co/ZGVJnwyLWm", "url": "https://x.com/ANancysilver/status/2113126003094499829"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113055104559697920"]}, "author_id": "1851900159585849346", "created_at": "2026-10-21T23:49:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113055110041661522"], "id": "2113055110041661522", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "消费级脑机接口（BCI）的破局点，可能不是炫酷的赛博头环，而是一顶让你忘了它存在的帽子。\n\n看了一下 Sabi Cap @sabi 脑机帽子，产品逻辑很清晰：把硬核技术“无感化”。再强的非侵入式脑电监测，如果戴出去像在医院做脑电图，就注定只能停留在极客圈。 https://t.co/KFE7LKr6jO", "url": "https://x.com/StevenXueNZ/status/2113055110041661522"}, {"author_id": "137233247", "created_at": "2026-10-22T01:29:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113080324481855623"], "id": "2113080324481855623", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 157, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "撕开狂想与绝密的帷幕：美国国防高级研究计划局（DARPA）的超前与疯狂\n\n在美军庞大的军工复合体中，美国国防高级研究计划局（#DARPA）始终扮演着最具神秘色彩的角色。它享有雄厚的预算支持，专注于所谓的**“蓝天研究”（Blue Sky Research），即不设限制地将科幻小说式的疯狂构想转化为现实武器与技术。", "url": "https://x.com/svskywalker/status/2113080324481855623"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113049646306373632"]}, "author_id": "1679698342283186177", "created_at": "2026-10-21T23:28:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113049724907557356"], "id": "2113049724907557356", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1092, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2110885325526716542", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "😲 OpenAI 和马斯克，又在脑机接口领域碰上了。\n\nAI 真的能治疗癌症？\n\nNeuralink 想让大脑控制电脑。\n\nOpenAI 新投资的 Coherence Neuro，却想让 AI 读取脑癌相关的电信号，甚至通过电刺激干预肿瘤生长。\n\n10 月 21 日，WIRED 披露：\n\nOpenAI Startup Fund 联合 Peter Thiel 旗下 Founders https://t.co/bQ1hPLw8DR https://t.co/Ezmxg9OmPq", "url": "https://x.com/MinLiBuilds/status/2113049724907557356"}, {"author_id": "1964937738291163136", "created_at": "2026-10-22T04:50:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113130939291480329"], "id": "2113130939291480329", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Elon牛逼！马斯克刚放出了脑机接口公司 Neuralink 的下一张王牌，名为 Blindsight 的视觉植入物即将登场，\n\n哪怕一个人彻底失明，这套设备也能跳过眼球直接把画面写进大脑的视觉皮层。", "url": "https://x.com/jardonhe18891/status/2113130939291480329"}, {"author_id": "2108191189019381760", "created_at": "2026-10-22T03:16:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113107073890177510"], "id": "2113107073890177510", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 123, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【开源医药】迈普医学:三季度利润增长18%,并购落地+脑机接口打开成长空间\n\n[庆祝]2026Q1-Q3实现营收2.94亿元左右(yoy+18%),归母净利润约0.90亿元(yoy+19%),扣非归母净利润约0.87亿元(yoy+19%),业绩实现稳健增长。", "url": "https://x.com/2030FY_X/status/2113107073890177510"}, {"author_id": "1655501623706419200", "created_at": "2026-10-22T00:27:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113064562820083968"], "id": "2113064562820083968", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 41, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "（3）在量子科技、生物制造、氢能和核聚变能、\n脑机接口、具身智能、第六代移动通信等前沿领域 探索多元技术路线、典型应用场景、可行商业模式。\n\n（4）全面实施“人工智能+”行动 推动人工智能全方位赋能千行百业。\n\n利好硬科技，生物制造，具身智能等等。", "url": "https://x.com/h86668/status/2113064562820083968"}, {"author_id": "1998210264572039168", "created_at": "2026-10-22T02:24:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113094045635588192"], "id": "2113094045635588192", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2090079668775063804", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "去中心化\n\n从区块链到AI，去中心化这个词又在我脑中闪现，因为刚看一个帖子讲路边AI，有趣，哈哈哈。\n\nPersonal agent目前是一个雏形与起点，未来每个人会有自己的一整套数据库在一个账号里（云存储，本地数据也可以全部上传云），随时可以在任何设备调用/处理事情/存储等等。 https://t.co/0udagOqXG0", "url": "https://x.com/nvshenjin/status/2113094045635588192"}, {"author_id": "1655501623706419200", "created_at": "2026-10-22T00:26:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113064500891107770"], "id": "2113064500891107770", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "（3）在量子科技、生物制造、氢能和核聚变能、\n脑机接口、具身智能、第六代移动通信等前沿领域 探索多元技术路线、典型应用场景、可行商业模式。\n\n（4）全面实施“人工智能+”行动 推动人工智能全方位赋能千行百业。", "url": "https://x.com/h86668/status/2113064500891107770"}, {"author_id": "1465893870483476482", "created_at": "2026-10-22T02:38:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113097707174936687"], "id": "2113097707174936687", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 71, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "未来科技的重点，正从屏幕里的 AI，延伸到科研、医疗、能源和深海。2026年世界科技与发展论坛发布“十大科技前瞻”，包括自主科研智能体、双向脑机接口、可控核聚变和太空制造等。你最看好哪个方向？ #科技 #AI", "url": "https://x.com/yang588688/status/2113097707174936687"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2017220079214059521"]}, "author_id": "1523533577081614336", "created_at": "2026-10-22T04:00:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113118154322817233"], "id": "2113118154322817233", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1363, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "以前大家觉得治失明，无非是换角膜、修视网膜。但要是眼球彻底坏死、视神经完全萎缩，传统医学基本就宣判死刑了。Neuralink 的思路简单粗暴得多：直接跳过眼睛和视神经，把信号“啪”一下直接怼进大脑的初级视觉皮层。说白了，就是完全绕过摄像头，直接把大脑当成显示器强行灌数据流。", "url": "https://x.com/realfxw/status/2113118154322817233"}, {"author_id": "464646709", "created_at": "2026-10-22T01:05:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113074105234731098"], "id": "2113074105234731098", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "1